# Workspace-root ignores. Each repo (hexschool-backend, hexschool-frontend)
# keeps its own .gitignore for build output and dependencies.

# Claude Code notify-extension hook artifacts. The hook in the global
# ~/.claude/settings.json runs `touch C:\Users\...\claude-notify-signals\stop`;
# Git Bash strips the backslashes, so it drops a file named after the whole
# path into the current working directory. Ignore them wherever they land.
C:Users*
*claude-notify-signals*

# Playwright browser-QA artifacts (see QA_RUNBOOK.md at the repo root).
#
# Transient run output — traces, videos, failure screenshots, saved auth state.
#
# The MCP server's --output-dir is .playwright-mcp (see .mcp.json) because it
# writes a page snapshot (.yml) and a console log per navigation, not just the
# screenshots you asked for — dozens of files per session. Curated evidence is
# copied deliberately into docs/qa/screenshots/, and upload inputs live in
# docs/qa/fixtures/; both of those ARE committed.
**/e2e/.auth/
**/e2e/.artifacts/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/blob-report/
**/.playwright/
**/.playwright-mcp/
# A bare-filename screenshot lands in the repo root; evidence images belong in
# docs/qa/screenshots/ instead, which is deliberately NOT ignored.
/*.png
/*.jpg
